{"path":"/saas-website-design/","slug":"saas-website-design","kind":"landing","title":"SaaS Website Design Agency | Legency Media","description":"A SaaS website design agency for marketing teams that ship: component systems you run without engineering, with conversion and AI visibility measured monthly.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/FaqSection.BU63QfoB.css","/_astro/ServiceLayout.DWPKQstD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"svc-hero svc-hero--proof\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"svc-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><div class=\"container svc-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Services</span><h1 class=\"svc-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>SaaS Website Design</h1><p class=\"svc-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>SaaS websites built around product pages, pricing and demo requests. Your marketing team can publish from a reusable component library, with ongoing support and monthly reporting on search, AI citations and enquiries.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><p class=\"svc-hero__proof\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>ChannelSight: structured data verified on 475 pages in July 2026. <a href=\"/case-studies/channelsight/\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>See the SaaS work ↗</a></p></div></section><section class=\"section evo\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__head\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Shipped by Marketing</span><h2 class=\"evo__heading\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>What a SaaS Website Design Agency Should Own</h2></div><div class=\"evo__grid\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Problem</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Standard Agency</span></div><div class=\"evo__cards\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M15 4V2M15 4V6M15 4H10.5M3 10V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21H19C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V10H3Z\"/><path d=\"M3 10V6C3 4.89543 3.89543 4 5 4H7\"/><path d=\"M7 2V6\"/><path d=\"M21 10V6C21 4.89543 20.1046 4 19 4H18.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Every landing page waits on a sprint</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Landing pages live in the same repository as the product, so a campaign page joins the engineering backlog behind release work. Marketing ends up planning around sprints instead of the market.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M18.5 15L5.5 15\"/><path d=\"M16 4L8 4\"/><path d=\"M9 4.5L9 10.2602C9 10.7376 8.82922 11.1992 8.51851 11.5617L3.48149 17.4383C3.17078 17.8008 3 18.2624 3 18.7398V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21L19 21C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V18.7398C21 18.2624 20.8292 17.8008 20.5185 17.4383L15.4815 11.5617C15.1708 11.1992 15 10.7376 15 10.2602L15 4.5\"/><path d=\"M12 9.01L12.01 8.99889\"/><path d=\"M11 2.01L11.01 1.99889\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Testing the pricing page costs a deploy</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A change to plans or tiers becomes a ticket, a review and a deploy. Testing a second version of that page costs so much attention that most teams stop asking for it.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M14 14V6M14 14L20.1023 17.487C20.5023 17.7156 21 17.4268 21 16.9661V3.03391C21 2.57321 20.5023 2.28439 20.1023 2.51296L14 6M14 14H7C4.79086 14 3 12.2091 3 10V10C3 7.79086 4.79086 6 7 6H14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M7.75716 19.3001L7 14H11L11.6772 18.7401C11.8476 19.9329 10.922 21 9.71716 21C8.73186 21 7.8965 20.2755 7.75716 19.3001Z\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>AI assistants find nothing to shortlist you with</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The site is written for a person scrolling. An AI assistant asked to shortlist vendors in the category finds nothing definite to quote, so it names somebody else.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Solution</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle evo__coltitle--brand\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"evo__logo\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Legency Approach</span></span></div><div class=\"evo__cards evo__cards--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Marketing launches without waiting on a sprint</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Every section is a governed Webflow component. A new landing page is assembled from parts that already carry the styling, the tracking and the accessibility work, and it goes live on the campaign date.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M16 13C13.2386 13 11 11.8807 11 10.5C11 9.11929 13.2386 8 16 8C18.7614 8 21 9.11929 21 10.5C21 11.8807 18.7614 13 16 13Z\"/><path d=\"M11 14.5C11 15.8807 13.2386 17 16 17C18.7614 17 21 15.8807 21 14.5\"/><path d=\"M3 9.5C3 10.8807 5.23858 12 8 12C9.12583 12 10.1647 11.814 11.0005 11.5\"/><path d=\"M3 13C3 14.3807 5.23858 15.5 8 15.5C9.12561 15.5 10.1643 15.314 11 15.0002\"/><path d=\"M3 5.5V16.5C3 17.8807 5.23858 19 8 19C9.12563 19 10.1643 18.8139 11 18.5\"/><path d=\"M13 8.5V5.5\"/><path d=\"M11 10.5V18.5C11 19.8807 13.2386 21 16 21C18.7614 21 21 19.8807 21 18.5V10.5\"/><path d=\"M8 8C5.23858 8 3 6.88071 3 5.5C3 4.11929 5.23858 3 8 3C10.7614 3 13 4.11929 13 5.5C13 6.88071 10.7614 8 8 8Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A pricing change is live the day it is decided</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Plans, tiers and feature tables are editable content rather than hard-coded layout, so a change goes live before the sales call and a test can run on one section at a time.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>AI assistants have something definite to quote</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Product, pricing and comparison pages answer plainly and carry the markup that tells a machine what each page is. Every month we check which assistants name you in your category, and who they name instead.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section foundation\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"foundation__head\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>What You Get</span><h2 class=\"foundation__heading\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>What Marketing Gets From a SaaS Build</h2></div></div><div class=\"foundation__grid\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Landing Pages Without a Sprint</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Marketing assembles new pages from approved sections. Each page gets cheaper as the library grows, and a prospect landing on the tenth campaign page sees the same site as on the first.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Conversion Measured to the Demo</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Signups and demo requests tracked to their source and reported monthly. On one platform we work with, organic search overtook paid as the source of demo requests: 39 people against 19 in a 28-day window.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M10 12H5C4.44772 12 4 11.5523 4 11V7.5C4 6.94772 4.44772 6.5 5 6.5H9C9.55228 6.5 10 6.94772 10 7.5V12ZM10 12C10 14.5 9 16 6 17.5\"/><path d=\"M20 12H15C14.4477 12 14 11.5523 14 11V7.5C14 6.94772 14.4477 6.5 15 6.5H19C19.5523 6.5 20 6.94772 20 7.5V12ZM20 12C20 14.5 19 16 16 17.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Named by AI Assistants, Checked Monthly</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude are checked every month for whether they name you in your category, and for who gets named instead, so the shortlist your buyers get from an assistant is one you can see and move.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M8.5 11.5L11.5 14.5L16.5 9.5\"/><path d=\"M5 18L3.13036 4.91253C3.05646 4.39524 3.39389 3.91247 3.90398 3.79912L11.5661 2.09641C11.8519 2.03291 12.1481 2.03291 12.4339 2.09641L20.096 3.79912C20.6061 3.91247 20.9435 4.39524 20.8696 4.91252L19 18C18.9293 18.495 18.5 21.5 12 21.5C5.5 21.5 5.07071 18.495 5 18Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Procurement Already Passed</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Requests land in a shared channel and go out the same day where scope allows, inside a process that has already cleared a 36-question enterprise security review and corporate accounts-payable billing.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>The Gap</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>Product Tours Do Not Answer Buying Questions</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>Most SaaS sites describe features in the order the product team built them. Buyers arrive with a different order: what does this replace, will it work with what we run, what does it cost, and who else like us uses it.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud><h3 data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>What it replaces</h3><p data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>Almost nothing is bought into a vacuum. Naming what the buyer is currently doing instead, including the spreadsheet, is what makes the value obvious without a single adjective.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud><h3 data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>What it connects to</h3><p data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>An integrations page is a qualification page. Buyers use it to disqualify quickly, which is a favour to your sales team, and the absence of one reads as a product that does not connect to anything.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud><h3 data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>What it costs, roughly</h3><p data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>You do not have to publish a price list to answer this. A shape, a range or the model itself lets a buyer self-qualify. Total silence means every enquiry has to be filtered by a human, most of them badly.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud><h3 data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>Who like us uses it</h3><p data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>Logos from a different segment argue against you. Proof that matches the reader's size and sector is the only proof that carries, which is why one relevant case study beats twelve irrelevant marks.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"section dp dp--alt\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>Speed of Change</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>A SaaS Site Changes More Than Any Other Kind</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>Pricing shifts, positioning shifts, a feature ships, a competitor moves. The site that wins is the one that keeps up, and the marketing team that can change it the same day is the one that stops missing windows.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards dp__cards--three\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud><h3 data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>Pricing that can be edited</h3><p data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>Pricing lives in the CMS rather than hand-built into a page, so a change is an edit rather than a ticket. Hard-coded pricing tables are why so many SaaS sites are quietly out of date.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud><h3 data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>Campaign pages in hours</h3><p data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>Built from the existing component set, so a launch does not queue behind a sprint. Landing pages stuck behind release work are the usual reason marketing ends up working around the website instead of through it.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-2kna3cud><h3 data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>Structured for search and answers</h3><p data-astro-cid-2kna3cud>Question-led pages and clean structure, so the same site earns rankings and gets quoted by AI assistants. Retrofitting that later costs more than building it in.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"caseband\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"pixelated-scroll-transition\" data-pixelated-scroll-transition data-columns=\"24\" data-columns-tablet=\"18\" data-columns-mobile=\"10\" data-rows=\"8\" data-mode=\"reveal\" style=\"color:var(--bg)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"caseband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div><div class=\"container caseband__inner\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"caseband__content\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Case Study</span><span class=\"caseband__chip\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/partners/channelsight.png\" alt=\"ChannelSight\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></span><h2 class=\"caseband__heading\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>A platform an engine can read.</h2><p class=\"caseband__text\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>ChannelSight sells a where-to-buy platform to consumer brands. In two months its site went from zero pages carrying machine-readable structure to 475 of 586, and crawler time lost to junk URLs fell 83%, 2,349 down to 410.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/case-studies/channelsight/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>View Case Study</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"caseband__media\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/covers/case-channelsight.jpg\" alt=\"A lit building facade in a regular grid, rendered as a blue pixel dither, captioned Readable to AI engines\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div></div></section><section class=\"ctaband\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz></div><div class=\"container ctaband__inner\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__text\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Start With the Questions</span><h2 class=\"ctaband__heading\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Find Out What Your Site Is Not Answering</h2><p class=\"ctaband__body\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Buyers arrive asking what this replaces, what it connects to, what it costs and who like them uses it. Most SaaS sites answer none of the four. A call about which ones matter most in your category.</p></div><div class=\"ctaband__side\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><ul class=\"ctaband__points\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>The four buying questions, and where they belong on a SaaS site</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Pricing and campaign pages marketing can change without a sprint</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Structured so the same pages earn rankings and get quoted by assistants</li></ul><div class=\"ctaband__actions\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"ctaband__quiet\" href=\"/aeo-agency/\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How we get sites cited by AI</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What makes a SaaS website different from any other B2B site?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>A SaaS buyer evaluates the product through the site before anyone speaks to them, so the site is the first version of the product they use. Pricing, product and comparison pages carry most of that evaluation, which means they need to change the day a decision is made, test one section at a time, and read as plainly to an AI assistant as to a person.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Can our marketing team ship landing pages without engineering?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes. Every section is a governed Webflow component, so a new campaign page is assembled from parts that already carry your styling, your tracking and the accessibility work, and it goes live without a sprint ticket or a deploy. Marketing plans launches around the market rather than around the release schedule.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Do you run pricing page experiments?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes. On one account we run two to three tests a month through Webflow Optimize, one section at a time, so each result is attributable to the change that caused it. Tracking is verified before a test starts, because a test measuring the wrong thing is worse than no test at all.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How does a SaaS site get named in AI answers?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Engines quote pages that answer plainly and carry the markup that tells a machine what each page is. We write the product, pricing and comparison pages that way, then check every month whether ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude name you in your category, and who they name instead. One client is now the most-cited domain in its answer set, named in 16 of 56 answers, more than three named competitors combined.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-4\" id=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How do you measure a SaaS website after launch?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Rankings, conversion on the pages that matter and AI citations, reported monthly in the same format, written so a marketing leader can forward it to a CEO or board as it is. On one platform we work with, organic search overtook paid as the source of demo requests: 39 people against 19 in a 28-day window.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".dp__grid[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{gap:var(--sp-5);grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;display:grid}.dp__heading[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{font-size:var(--h4);margin-bottom:var(--sp-3);max-width:24ch}.dp__text[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud] p[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud],.dp__sub[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{font-size:var(--para-sm);max-width:56ch;margin-bottom:var(--sp-2)}.dp__note[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{opacity:.7}.dp__head[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);max-width:64ch}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{background:var(--white)}.dp__cards[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{gap:var(--sp-3);grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));display:grid}.dp__cards--three[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.dp__card[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:var(--sp-4)}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud] .dp__card[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{background:var(--bg)}.dp__card[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud] h3[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{font-size:var(--h6);margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);max-width:26ch}.dp__card[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud] p[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{font-size:var(--para-sm)}.dp__steps[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{gap:var(--sp-2);list-style:none;display:grid}.dp__step[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{gap:var(--sp-4);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:var(--sp-4);grid-template-columns:max-content minmax(0,1fr);display:grid}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud] .dp__step[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{background:var(--bg)}.dp__num[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{font-family:var(--font-title);font-weight:500;font-size:var(--h6);color:var(--blue);line-height:1}.dp__step[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud] h3[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{font-size:var(--h6);margin-bottom:var(--sp-2)}.dp__step[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud] p[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{font-size:var(--para-sm);max-width:74ch}.dp__foot[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{margin-top:var(--sp-3);font-size:var(--para-sm);opacity:.7;max-width:72ch}@media (width<=900px){.dp__grid[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud],.dp__cards[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud],.dp__cards--three[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud],.dp__step[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{grid-template-columns:1fr}.dp__step[data-astro-cid-2kna3cud]{gap:var(--sp-2)}}",".pixelated-scroll-transition{z-index:10;pointer-events:none;position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0}[data-pixelated-scroll-panel]{flex-direction:row;width:100%;displa